    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78461" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραναίω</span></b> , aor. 1
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρένασσα</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cause to dwell, settle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Aet.Oxy.</u>
				2080.53
			</span></i>. </div>
